  "summary": [
    "Eight helpers and ten rows use one supplied-colour-map predicate over upstream coloring/preim_partition. Five Prop wrappers keep iff; three finite-function Boolean wrappers keep equality. Empty palettes and unused labels require no added guard.",
    "Eight family-reaching helper chains are frozen. Recolouring states, CSF coefficients and three-colouring counts retain their exact labelled finite-function representations and counts.",
    "X64Original combines frozen colouring with the pre-M1/A3 deletion chain. X83Original combines frozen colouring with B3 induced paths. Historical snapshot bodies and theorem types are unchanged; their live colouring references are explicit below.",
    "X162 retains its blocked Kempe defect; D5 its existential affirmative question; D4doa its documented Cauchy-existence reading. Ten statement bodies, docs and statuses are unchanged. Edge-colouring families remain separate."
  ],
